{"name":"Vendela","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Verdant","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vermeil","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vetochki","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vigil","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vigna","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vina Victoria","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Violet Mizutsune Orchid","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Virtuosa","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Viviana","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Viy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vulcan","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Vulpisfoglia","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"W","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Waai Fu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wakaba Mutsumi","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wang","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wanqing","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Warfarin","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Warmy","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Weedy","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whislash","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Whisperain","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wild Mane","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wind Chimes","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windflit","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Windscoot","rarity":4,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wiš'adel","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Wulfenite","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Xingzhu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yahata Umiri","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yato","rarity":2,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yu","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Yūtenji Nyamu","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zima the Raging Tide","rarity":6,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zinogre S Catapult","rarity":5,"isFuture":null},{"name":"Zuo Le","rarity":6,"isFuture":null}],"techniqueUnitIcons":{},"techniqueBranchOperators":{},"techniqueGroupOperators":{},"techniqueRelatedOperators":{},"forms":null,"skillRanges":null,"overviewRanges":[{"elite":0,"talent":null,"range":{"cols":2,"rows":1,"opCell":[1,1],"rangeCells":[[1,2]]}}],"voiceData":{"textLocale":"en","lines":[{"id":"CN_001","title":"Appointed as Assistant","text":"Boss, let's go grab a bite. On you this time. What? You bought last time? Doesn't sound right to me.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":1},{"id":"CN_002","title":"Talk 1","text":"Use my head to win fights? Hmm… Hmm… Pummel them until I win, train harder if I lose. That's using your head!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":2},{"id":"CN_003","title":"Talk 2","text":"Honey's sweet, but getting it hurts. I went for some the other day… They really give me a hard lesson.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":3},{"id":"CN_004","title":"Talk 3","text":"My knuckles? Haha~ They're my precious babies. Wouldn't have racked up all those wins without 'em!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":4},{"id":"CN_005","title":"Talk after Promotion 1","text":"There's more rules in the underground fight scene than you might think. Plenty of gopniks dove in before they had 'em figured out. They usually ended up dead.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":5},{"id":"CN_006","title":"Talk after Promotion 2","text":"Oripathy? Who cares? Infected, Uninfected... They're all the same after I knock their lights out.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":6},{"id":"CN_007","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","text":"What? The fin in the kitchen? Hah! Right here in my belly now!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":7},{"id":"CN_008","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","text":"My book of names here? Ah, looks like that big brain of yours doesn't know everything. Gotta meet people to fight people, right? I don't want to run out of enemies.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":8},{"id":"CN_009","title":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","text":"The only reason I joined the underground fight is 'cause I didn't have two kopecks to rub together. But here on Rhodes Island I got that load off my mind. It's all thanks to you, Boss!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":9},{"id":"CN_010","title":"Idle","text":"Smells like grilled fish!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":10},{"id":"CN_011","title":"Onboard","text":"Yo! Boss, you know a winner when you see her! Now, put your hands together for the strongest underground fighter out there. The one! The only! BEEEEEEEE-HUNTERRRRRR!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":11},{"id":"CN_012","title":"Watching Battle Record","text":"I really don't wanna study. Send me out to fight already!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":12},{"id":"CN_013","title":"Promotion 1","text":"Hah hah hah! Somebody likes me a lot!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":13},{"id":"CN_014","title":"Promotion 2","text":"Hah! After this promotion, ain't no way I'm gonna let you down! Lemme show you what I can do in a fight, Boss!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":14},{"id":"CN_017","title":"Added to Squad","text":"Here I come!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":17},{"id":"CN_018","title":"Appointed as Squad Leader","text":"Chow's on me after we win this one!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":18},{"id":"CN_019","title":"Depart","text":"Relax, Boss. Ain't nobody can go three rounds with me!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":19},{"id":"CN_020","title":"Begin Operation","text":"So you're the ones looking for a beatdown. You guys?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":20},{"id":"CN_021","title":"Selecting Operator 1","text":"What's up?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":21},{"id":"CN_022","title":"Selecting Operator 2","text":"Ready?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":22},{"id":"CN_023","title":"Deployment 1","text":"Gimme the bell!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":23},{"id":"CN_024","title":"Deployment 2","text":"Let's do this.","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":24},{"id":"CN_025","title":"In Battle 1","text":"Eat this!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":25},{"id":"CN_026","title":"In Battle 2","text":"Get over here!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":26},{"id":"CN_027","title":"In Battle 3","text":"One-two, one-two, one-two!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":27},{"id":"CN_028","title":"In Battle 4","text":"C'mon, c'mon! Bring it on!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":28},{"id":"CN_029","title":"4-star Result","text":"The stronger the matchup, the more pumped I get!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":29},{"id":"CN_030","title":"3-star Result","text":"K.O.! Check it out, Boss. See 'em all piled up there?","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":30},{"id":"CN_031","title":"Sub 3-star Result","text":"That's a wrap. Let's head back and chow down!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":31},{"id":"CN_032","title":"Operation Failure","text":"Ouch… Where's the Boss? Is the Boss okay?!","category":"combat","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":32},{"id":"CN_033","title":"Assigned to Facility","text":"This room's a lot better than any I had before!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":33},{"id":"CN_034","title":"Tap","text":"Hm?","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":34},{"id":"CN_036","title":"Trust Tap","text":"You brought food? You're the best, Boss!","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":36},{"id":"CN_037","title":"Title","text":"Arknights.","category":"profile","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":37},{"id":"CN_038","title":"New Year's blessing","text":"Hey, hey, hey! There you are, boss! I was just out having some honey with the others! Man, it's nice to have a stable income. Now I can buy as much honey as I want. Sure beats gathering it myself, with all the stinging... You're the best, boss!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":38},{"id":"CN_042","title":"Greeting","text":"What's up, Boss.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":42},{"id":"CN_043","title":"Birthday","text":"Honey-grilled fins! I just came up with the recipe a few days ago, and it's sure to be a blast! Same goes for fin jerky with honey. Why aren't I sharing any then? I couldn't hold myself back and ate it all last night.","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":43},{"id":"CN_044","title":"Anniversary Celebration","text":"The way Rhodes Island fights is different from what I'm used to, but that doesn't bother me one bit! And I only learned after coming here how many people look down on the Infected. But don't worry! Me and my fist will change their minds!","category":"special","status":"current","unlock":null,"order":44}],"packs":[{"id":"en","label":"English","actors":["Emma Breezy"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-english/main/current/char_137_brownb/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"jp","label":"Japanese","actors":["Yuko Hara"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-japanese/main/current/char_137_brownb/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"cn","label":"Mandarin","actors":["Duduru"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-mandarin/main/current/char_137_brownb/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"},{"id":"kr","label":"Korean","actors":["Kwak Kyumi"],"status":"current","audioTemplate":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/arkpedia/arkpedia-voice-korean/main/current/char_137_brownb/{voiceIdLower}.mp3"}]}}}